<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - St. Paul Cos cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - St. Paul Cos cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Everen said it downgraded St. Paul Cos Inc to long-term market perform from long-term outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- St. Paul lost 7/8 to 61-3/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
